ent-TarkovStationStashTerminal = personal stash terminal
    .desc = Storage at Pereval. Items last until the end of this cycle.
ent-TarkovStationRaidConsole = raid deployment terminal
    .desc = Sign up and ready your party. Deployment follows the countdown.
ent-TarkovStationContractBoard = contract board
    .desc = Player contracts backed by escrowed rewards.
ent-TarkovStationExtractionBeacon = extraction beacon
    .desc = Approach and activate. Extraction requires a living character and is interrupted by damage.

ent-TarkovStationResultsTerminal = cycle results terminal
    .desc = Wealth, kills and results of the completed cycle.
ent-TarkovStationTradeTerminal = barter terminal
    .desc = Mutually confirmed item and credit exchanges backed by escrow.
